---
id: inhabited_repair_cafe
title: The Repair Cafe
---
=== workbench
~ wing_aligned = false
~ spring_wound = false
~ chalk_star = false
A mechanical moth rests beside two cups of tea. The repairs made here belong to everyone. Iris has opened the window; once the wing and spring are ready, someone else can let the moth fly.
* [Align the moth's wing] { wing_aligned == false }
  ~ wing_aligned = true
  -> workbench
* [Wind the tiny spring] { spring_wound == false }
  ~ spring_wound = true
  -> workbench
* [Release the repaired moth] { wing_aligned && spring_wound }
  -> window
=== window
The moth circles the lamps and lands against the window. Its wings cast a constellation across the ceiling. Beside the empty table is a small piece of chalk: a place to begin another shared invention.
* [Leave a chalk star for the next visitor] { chalk_star == false }
  ~ chalk_star = true
  -> window
